# Strict API cost requirement

Do not use the OpenAI API or any paid AI API. Google Gemini is the only allowed AI provider for the assistant, on a free-tier-eligible model.

- Use `GEMINI_API_KEY` only. Never add `OPENAI_API_KEY` or OpenAI SDKs.
- Do not install, import, configure, or call OpenAI.
- Do not add paid AI providers as automatic fallbacks.
- Do not enable paid billing or incur API charges without explicit user permission.
- If Gemini hits free limits or is down: helpful message or non-AI fallback. The rest of the app must keep working.
- Before implementing the assistant, verify the chosen Gemini model’s current free-tier eligibility and limits.
- Prefer free tools and service tiers. Label anything that might cost money.
- Never assume a service is free or turn on a paid plan without approval.

Before adding any external service, state: free option (yes/no), limits, and whether payment may be required. Ask for approval before any paid dependency.
